# Shared build context for both Dockerfile (backend) and web/Dockerfile
# (frontend) - see docs/OPEN_POINTS.md item 34. Keeps the build context
# small and reproducible: no local caches, VCS metadata, or dev-only state
# leaking into an image layer.
.git/
.zonaryos/
docs/
*.md
LICENSE

# Go build artifacts (never needed inside the build context - the build
# stage compiles from source)
bin/
dist/

# Frontend: node_modules/.next are rebuilt inside the image; committing the
# host's copy in would be stale and enormous
web/node_modules/
web/.next/
web/coverage/
